Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||01-15-2000||04:05 AM||||Ya I was out cruisin tonight at the local strip and I beat a dodge r/t 5.9 from about a 25 roll to 60 wghere I let off (speed limit is 45)then I raced assorted accuras and what not and the offered little or no competition.  Then some guy pulled up in an old rx7 and wanted to go so the first time he jumped me and was off before my car kicked down into low gear.  then we caught a light and he didn't go from the light so I din't know if the guy was screwin with me or wanted a race so he catches up to me and rolled down his window and was like I can't go from a stop so we went from about a 10 roll and I floored it and my car kicked down and and he took off right as mine kicked down so it was a real good start and he hung weith me for a second but I had at least 2 car links by second.  I really want to race a stock automatic 4.6 stang, cause I bet I could really suprise them, my friend has a gt probe that can beat them on occasion and they are usually pissed!  Well this is really only my second time out to the strip with it but I take of for my first semester a swt on sunday,  But today my fuse for the radio/horn/interior lights has started popping I went through 3 fuses before I quit doing it.  I will put a new one in and the first one the radio played for like 30 minutes and popped when I was just driving then the second one went for about 15-20 minutes and pooped once again when I was driving and the third lasted about 5 minutes.  Every time it pooped I was not turning anything on or off or adjusting anything I was just cruisin along and pop, then my radio cut off then someone cut me off and I went to use the horn and wasn't working and then I noteiced the interior light went off to!  Does anyone know what could be causing this???  I think it might be some of the stuff we wired up to the cigarete lighter (ie changer, crossover and other stero stuff)I am thinking something might be grounding out in there.  I have tomorow to fix it before I take off to school!  If anyone else has had that problem  please let me know I will check the post in the am!<BR>||||reg||12
